# Keeps secrets and bulk files out of Cursor's indexing and default context.
# It does NOT stop terminal or MCP tools from reading files; the data and secret rules still apply.
# Never ignore AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, SOUL.md, .cursor/rules/, docs/ or configs/.

# Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
.ssh/
.agent-lock

# Bulk data and generated outputs (inspect them through audit programs, not context)
data/raw/
data/interim/
data/processed/
runs/
submissions/**/*.csv
artifacts/models/
logs/
backups/

# Environments and caches
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# NFS junk created by the storage layer
**/.!!!*
